abstract: >-
  Exact, dependency-free finite computational certificate for the reduction of a
  Barning-Berggren Pythagorean congruence graph modulo 49 to modulo 7 above the
  root (3,4,5). It verifies a 49-point fibre, monodromy order 686, a translation
  kernel of order 49, a dihedral linear image of order 14, and two explicit
  positive loops generating an order-343 Heisenberg subgroup. Additional primes
  are finite regression checks only. No theorem for all odd primes or all
  congruence levels is claimed.
keywords:
  - Pythagorean triples
  - Barning-Berggren tree
  - monodromy
  - congruence graph
  - Heisenberg group
  - exact computation
  - Schreier graph
